      "items": [
        {
          "q": "Until when is morning plov served?",
          "a": "From 8:00 to 11:00 or until the kazan runs out — on weekends usually by ten. Call ahead to keep a portion for you."
        },
        {
          "q": "Can I book a topchan?",
          "a": "Yes, by phone or Telegram. A topchan seats 6–8, and we hold the booking for 20 minutes."
        },
        {
          "q": "Do you deliver?",
          "a": "Across Tashkent from 10:00 to 22:00. Plov on lagans by order a day ahead."
        },
        {
          "q": "What is the minimum banquet?",
          "a": "The banquet hall from 30 guests, the courtyard from 15. We agree the menu a week ahead."
        },
        {
          "q": "Do you have meat-free dishes?",
          "a": "Yes: pumpkin manti and samsa, vegetable shurpa, salads and all the sweets."
